420	068 & Trained ($d{=}32$) & $6.57\times$ & 39.1 & Yes (alert @85K) \\
421	067 & Frozen ($d{=}32$, \texttt{req\_grad=F}) & $0.40\times$ & 281.5 & No \\
422	069 & Removed ($d{=}0$) & $0.66\times$ & 237.8 & No \\
